#: ../../using/editors.rst:7
msgid "Editors and IDEs"
msgstr "Editory a IDE"

#: ../../using/editors.rst:9
msgid ""
"There are a number of IDEs that support Python programming language. Many "
"editors and IDEs provide syntax highlighting, debugging tools, and :pep:`8` "
"checks."
msgstr ""
"Existuje řada IDE, která podporují programovací jazyk Python. Mnoho editorů "
"a IDE poskytuje zvýrazňování syntaxe, nástroje pro ladění a kontroly "
":pep:`8`."

#: ../../using/editors.rst:14
msgid "IDLE --- Python editor and shell"
msgstr "IDLE --- editor a shell pro Python"

#: ../../using/editors.rst:16
msgid ""
"IDLE is Python’s Integrated Development and Learning Environment and is "
"generally bundled with Python installs. If you are on Linux and do not have "
"IDLE installed see :ref:`Installing IDLE on Linux "
"<installing_idle_on_linux>`. For more information see the :ref:`IDLE docs "
"<idle>`."
msgstr ""
"IDLE je integrované vývojové a výukové prostředí pro Python a je obvykle "
"bundled s instalacemi Pythonu. Pokud používáte Linux a nemáte IDLE "
"nainstalovaný, přečtěte si :ref:`Instalace IDLE na Linuxu "
"<installing_idle_on_linux>`. Více informací naleznete v :ref:`dokumentaci "
"IDLE <idle>`."

#: ../../using/editors.rst:22
msgid "Other Editors and IDEs"
msgstr "Další editory a IDE"

#: ../../using/editors.rst:24
msgid ""
"Python's community wiki has information submitted by the community on "
"Editors and IDEs. Please go to `Python Editors "
"<https://wiki.python.org/moin/PythonEditors>`_ and `Integrated Development "
"Environments "
"<https://wiki.python.org/moin/IntegratedDevelopmentEnvironments>`_ for a "
"comprehensive list."
msgstr ""
"Komunitní wiki Pythonu obsahuje informace zaslané komunitou o editorech a "
"IDE. Navštivte prosím `Python Editors "
"<https://wiki.python.org/moin/PythonEditors>`_ a `Integrated Development "
"Environments "
"<https://wiki.python.org/moin/IntegratedDevelopmentEnvironments>`_ pro úplný"
" seznam."
